*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.idea/

# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
/pubspec.lock
**/doc/api/
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
/build/
/coverage/

# Local agent instructions and working notes, not part of the package.
Claude.md
CLAUDE.md
Claude.v0.1.md
Claude_*.md
docs/phase0*.md
